# Shared settings for everyone working on MathTest (this file IS uploaded to GitHub).
#
# These two values are PUBLIC by design: Supabase's project address and its
# *publishable* key. Every visitor's browser receives them anyway. What
# protects the data is Row Level Security in the database (supabase/schema.sql).
#
# NEVER put a secret here: no "sb_secret_…" key, no "service_role" key, no
# database password. (src/lib/supabase/envSafety.test.ts checks this.)
#
# To use a different Supabase project on your own computer, put the same two
# lines in ".env.local" (never uploaded) — it overrides this file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://alvphukudenvxqirbqtm.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_BAb_MbBmS-rWylLqGZ6bVA_q7Fy1LPX
